<li>Your user profile and account-linked records stored in Firebase Realtime Database.</li>
<li>Other personal information or user-generated content associated with your account and controlled by the app, where applicable.</li>
</ul>
<p>Some records may be retained if they are necessary for legal compliance, fraud prevention, security, dispute resolution, or financial/accounting obligations. Any retained data will be limited to what is necessary and kept only for the legally or operationally required period.</p>

<h2>Rewards, points, and withdrawal records</h2>
<p>If your account contains points, rewards, withdrawal requests, transaction history, or payment-related records, please be aware that deletion of your account may remove access to your account and its in-app history. Records that must be retained for legal, accounting, fraud-prevention, or dispute-resolution purposes may be kept for the period required by applicable law. Contact support before requesting deletion if you have a pending withdrawal or unresolved balance.</p>

<h2>Processing your request</h2>
<p>We will review your request and may ask for reasonable information to verify account ownership. Once verified, we will process deletion within the period required by applicable law and our operational process. If you publish a specific processing deadline or retention period, ensure it reflects your actual practice.</p>

